  triage:snippet "claim_next_pending (pending_nudge_store.rs, ORDER BY message_key) ignores task queue position and delivers the full Task call-to-action for a queued non-head assignment; record_queue_prompt_reminders (herdr_queue_wake/task_pass.rs:105-146) then records that delivery's Reminded(emitted) event against queue_reminder_head(member) -- the head task's counter -- not the task whose message was actually delivered, so the event log undercounts nudges on non-head tasks and overcounts them on the head" ;
